<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine currency reserves up to $2.13 bln June 31.</title>
<headline>Ukraine currency reserves up to $2.13 bln June 31.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine's gross hard currency reserves rose  to $2.13 billion on June 31 from $1.88 billion on May 31, the central  bank said in its monthly report on Friday.</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom +380 44 244-9150</p>
</text>
